[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unitworldenvorder"]

; Two WorldEnvironments: an instanced one with a red background, then an authored one with a
; blue background. Godot applies the first in tree order (world_environment.cpp:77-83,
; scene_tree.cpp:1568-1581), so the view is red, although the instanced one loads after the
; authored one. Every other golden holds one WorldEnvironment, so only this one shows which wins.

